+## Stop and defer criteria
+
+Stop the active PR and return to plan review when:
+
+- a migration requires Alembic/Supabase, a second journal, an occupied revision,
+  mixed/unknown history, or destructive data repair;
+- a caller identity, tenant, actor, origin, membership, or evidence reference is
+  inferred from email, equality, labels, provider payload, model output, or
+  request body;
+- any completion/extraction/refresh/Adjust/provider/agent path can write work or
+  memory automatically;
+- a denied derivative can enter count, rank, retrieval, model input, response,
+  logs, or cache;
+- a PR exceeds the medium bound or owns files from another live lane;
+- required Neon/API/web/browser evidence is missing, skipped, zero-test,
+  uncleaned, timed out, or non-reconstructable;
+- terminal work starts before its migration ownership is reconciled to
+  `packages/db` and exact A/B heads are recorded;
+- provider work begins before local MVP, consent/capability/cost gates, and the
+  canonical evidence envelope pass;
+- a canvas implementation starts without a new approved engine GO;
+- TanStack Query expansion is mixed into a security/authority PR;
+- a vendor runtime is proposed as Product-Suite identity, membership, evidence,
+  approval, run, schedule, conversation, or work-item authority.
+
+## MVP release gate
+
+The MVP is complete only when one checked-in, non-skipping exact-head scenario:
+
+1. starts from a local captured transcript with durable contiguous drain;
+2. finalizes once to `completed` and refreshes a current summary;
+3. shows a summary that can be Adjusted but never Added;
+4. shows compact action candidates with verified omissions/chips;
+5. proves Adjust creates only a new meeting-owned version;
+6. proves Dismiss creates no work and Restore is explicit;
+7. proves Add creates exactly one linked work item under current membership;
+8. proves retry/reconnect/stale/revoked/cross-tenant/DB-failure paths create no
+   duplicate or unauthorized work;
+9. proves zero automatic proposal/work-item/memory delta before the human Add;
+10. leaves external connectors, visual generation, chat expansion, and canvas
+    absent from the critical path.
