+## Genuine parallel packet
+
+### Local durability `d88d461a-c259-4dc6-a751-f2b3c6898b7a`
+
+First run `/plan` because the live issue has no acceptance criteria or task
+artifact. The bounded outcome is capture-session identity, monotonic transcript
+sequence, contiguous acknowledgement, reload drain, and consent/indicator
+preservation. It may proceed in parallel with Neon/A/B only if it owns no
+authority schema, review card, candidate, finalizer, or shared migration files.
+Its validated head becomes an input to terminal PR 1/2.
+
+## Human-flow acceptance scenario
+
+1. Start local capture under explicit consent/indicator.
+2. Stop after partial and final transcript segments; reconnect once; drain the
+   same monotonic session to one contiguous watermark.
+3. Finalize using one stable terminal event; retry and prove one canonical result.
+4. Refresh and show the current summary before announcing completion.
+5. Adjust the summary inline; verify a new meeting-owned version and no Add.
+6. Adjust one action candidate; verify no work/memory write.
+7. Dismiss another; verify no work and explicit Restore.
+8. Add one current candidate with only displayed confirmed suggestions; verify
+   one proposal/work item and one result link.
+9. Repeat Add, race stale Add/Dismiss, revoke membership, and attempt cross-
+   tenant access; verify the same result or safe denial with no duplicate.
+
+## Agent/service acceptance scenario
+
+1. Finalizer emits only meeting-owned summary/action evidence.
+2. Materializer creates/reuses immutable versions and never work/memory.
+3. Tool-free Adjust receives only displayed subject/evidence/user text and can
+   produce only a nonterminal structured version.
+4. Deterministic Add repeats current authorization in the winning atomic write.
+5. No provider, model, Cloudflare Agent, LiveKit participant, AI SDK workflow,
+   calendar event, or chat transport becomes Product-Suite authority.
